[[Fleshreaver Hound]]s are [[monk]]s that provide [[hex]] and [[condition]] removal to their squads, while doing massive [[area of effect]] [[holy damage]]. They appear in large numbers and will tend to cast Ray of Judgment on the same targets, potentially doing huge damage to clustered parties, especially in [[Hard mode]].

